      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "现在很多衣服很快就过时了。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9444,
      "back_translation": "人们买很多便宜的衣服，穿几次以后就不要了。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9412,
      "back_translation": "这种现象叫做“快时尚”。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "快时尚让服装公司生产越来越多的纺织品。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "生产这些纺织品需要大量的水。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9143,
      "back_translation": "比如，做一件棉T恤可能要用掉两千升水。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9286,
      "back_translation": "这会加重全球水资源短缺的问题。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9143,
      "back_translation": "特别是在一些干旱地区，工厂还是用大量的水来做衣服，让当地居民更难找到足够的水。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9545,
      "back_translation": "不仅如此，生产过程中排放的废水常常含有化学物质。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "这些废水进入河流和土壤，造成严重的污染。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9565,
      "back_translation": "有时候一条干净的河流经过工业区以后就变得又黑又臭。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9615,
      "back_translation": "虽然有些公司说他们在改进，但是整个供应链的监管还是很薄弱。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "很多工厂为了省钱，不处理污水。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9091,
      "back_translation": "快时尚背后是一种强烈的消费主义文化。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.963,
      "back_translation": "广告鼓励人们不断购买新款式。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "社交媒体也让大家觉得旧衣服不好看。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "人们买得越多，浪费就越多。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7442,
      "back_translation": "大部分旧衣服没有被回收，而是被烧掉或者埋在地下。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.88,
      "back_translation": "这不仅浪费资源，而且伤害环境。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 19,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9455,
      "back_translation": "为了解决这个问题，消费者可以买质量好、耐穿的衣服，减少购买次数。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 20,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9583,
      "back_translation": "一些国家已经开始推行环保法规，要求企业对供应链负责。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 21,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9825,
      "back_translation": "虽然改变不容易，但是每个人都可以从小事做起，减少对水资源的压力。"
    }
